      "claim": "The query is a permanently charged quaternary ammonium tropane ester. Direct low-F evidence for quaternary ammonium antimuscarinics and strongly cationic small molecules (diphemanil very low F after 250 mg oral; DX-9065a human F 2–3%, 2.8 ± 1.5% as conventional capsule) supports F < 20%.",
      "card_ids": ["C06", "C01", "C04", "C16"]
